# Review rubric for business-requirements.md (read by sdkit review plan business-requirements). Copy to <project-dir>/review.d/business-requirements.env to change it.
# Names are EGM shortnames: reviewer = agents/<name>.md, standard = resources/document_standards/<name>.md of the egm plugin.
# The document is for developers, analysts, customers and PMs and is a derived view of the spec: the reviewers read it as a reader who is not
# an engineer (comprehension), and check that it says nothing the spec does not (design_critic, against the spec files in CONTEXT).
REVIEWERS="comprehension design_critic style"
STANDARDS="comprehension=heilmeier-standard design_critic=heilmeier-standard"
CONTEXT=".sdkit/project.md"
# REVIEWERS_R1="comprehension"
# TIER_R1=light
